# Manhunt Achievements -- a translation of the gallery
#
# For a language the mod does not ship (it ships English, French, German,
# Italian, Spanish and Russian) -- a fan translation through MHLL, say.
# Copy this file to a name ending in .txt in this same folder (ptbr.txt,
# polski.txt, ...), translate it, and save it as UTF-8. Several languages can
# sit here side by side.
#
# Match is how a file says which language it is for: the game's own
# "control type" label in that language, exactly as the game shows it (the
# first row of Settings > Controls). The mod uses the file whose Match is what
# the game shows, so switching the game's language -- MHLL's included --
# switches the gallery with it. A file with no Match line is used only when the
# game is in English or a language the mod does not ship.
#
# Below that, the gallery's own words, then the 33 achievements in the
# gallery's order (the PS4 trophy list's): a number and the name, and on the
# next line the description. A one-word label with a colon in front of the
# description ("Description:") is dropped, so a trophy list copied from a
# website goes in nearly as it is. Lines starting with #, ; or [ are ignored,
# and anything you leave out stays English.
#
# Write the letters exactly as your translation's GXT files do: if its font
# draws one letter in place of another, use that one here too.
#
# TitleCount must keep its two %d: they become "12/33".

# Put your language's label here and remove the #, for example:
# Match = TIPO DE CONTROLE

Gallery.Title          = ACHIEVEMENTS
Gallery.TitleCount     = ACHIEVEMENTS %d/%d
Gallery.Unlocked       = ACHIEVEMENT UNLOCKED
Gallery.KeyboardSelect = Arrows / wheel: select
Gallery.KeyboardPages  = Tabs: page
Gallery.Select         = select
Gallery.Pages          = pages
Gallery.Back           = back

1. Psychopath
Description: Unlock all achievements.

2. He Never Saw it Coming
Description: Perform a gruesome execution.

3. 5-Star Killer
Description: Earn a 5-star rating for any level.

4. Drug Free is the Way to Be
Description: Complete any scene on Hardcore difficulty without using any painkillers.

5. Bang, Bang, Boom
Description: Kill a hunter by shooting an explosive tank.

6. No Crane, No Gain
Description: Crush a hunter with a refrigerator.

7. Are You Afraid of the Dark?
Description: Hide a victim's body in the shadows.

8. Pink Mist
Description: Headshot a hunter with a sniper rifle.

9. Brain Power
Description: Use a severed head to lure a hunter.

10. Enemy Efficient
Description: Kill two hunters with one shotgun shell.

11. Ooh, Ooh, Aah, Aah!
Description: Play any scene wearing the Monkey skin.

12. Follow the White Rabbit
Description: Complete any scene wearing the Rabbit skin.

13. Death from Behind
Description: Complete any scene using only executions.

14. Stick to the Shadows
Description: Complete any scene going completely undetected.

15. Line 'Em Up, Knock 'Em Down
Description: Kill 30 hunters in Hard as Nails.

16. Fun With Fisticuffs
Description: Survive until 30 hunters have been killed in the Brawl Game.

17. Ape Escape
Description: Escape the Zoo alive in Monkey See, Monkey Die!

18. You're Going Nowhere!
Description: Kill all the Hoods in Time 2 Die in seven minutes or less.

19. Hunter Season
Description: Kill 45 hunters in one scene.

20. Off With Their Heads!
Description: Execute 20 hunters in one scene.

21. Hard as Nails
Description: Earn at least three stars on scenes 1 through 5.

22. Brawl Game
Description: Earn at least three stars on scenes 6 through 10.

23. Monkey See, Monkey Die!
Description: Earn at least three stars on scenes 11 through 15.

24. Time 2 Die
Description: Earn at least three stars on scenes 16 through 20.

25. Murderous
Description: Complete every scene on Hardcore difficulty.

26. Dangerous
Description: Complete every scene on Fetish difficulty.

27. 4-Star Freak
Description: Earn a 4-star rating for every scene on Fetish Difficulty.

28. 5-Star Fiend
Description: Earn a 5-star rating for every scene on Hardcore Difficulty.

29. Getting Your Hands Dirty
Description: Kill 10 hunters in one scene using only your fists.

30. Swinging for the Fences
Description: Kill 10 hunters in one scene using a baseball bat.

31. The Grim Reaper
Description: Kill 10 hunters in one scene using a sickle.

32. Subtle Slaughter
Description: Perform an execution with the chainsaw.

33. A Special Gift
Description: Bring the patrolling hunter's head to the Guard Room during "Mouth of Madness".
